ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi196: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; outer EDGE_LOOP has 5 LINE edges; E1 has 3D LINE from (5,0,0) to (15,0,0) — geometrically non-degenerate — but its pcurve trim range is [5.0,5.0] (zero-width); BRep_Tool::Degenerated returns false (misses it); FixDegenerated fails to detect trim-induced zero-length — zero-length-after-trim IS the mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND -> ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
